Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 05:11:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/12] test-posix: Check assert's report, NDEBUG and
 re-including <assert.h>

A false assertion writes the expression, file, line and function to
stderr and aborts; with NDEBUG the argument isn't evaluated, and
including <assert.h> again without it turns assert back on.
